{"id":"vod_md_5525","vodId":"5525","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"绝对双刃","name_cn":"绝对双刃","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231001-1/9b8c75e727787b92f595f199bbaf56c9.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为“昊陵学园”的武术训练学校之中。拥有悲惨过去的九重透流（松冈祯丞 配音）带着满心的愤怒和抱负来到此处就读，希望能够在这里磨练技艺，变得强大替死去的妹妹报仇。校园中推行了一项名为“绊双刃”的特殊制度，学生们必须两两结成绊双刃，同吃同住，以加深彼此的羁绊。羁绊越深，两人得到的力量就越强大。在校园里，九重透流邂逅了名为朱莉（山本希望 配音）的北欧女孩，两人结下了羁绊，就此开始了同居生活。除此之外，傲娇任性的莉莉丝（山崎遥 配音）、迟钝耿直的橘巴（诹访彩花 配音）、身体孱弱的穗高雅（今村彩夏 饰），这些可爱的女孩们都将在学校里找到她们维系一生的羁绊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-01 07:14:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/WRY8jk9i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/wxaGl2oL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/1j7em6nn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/oN0gb57d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/82TB2M9f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/9TQg1rLH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/VSL7DGol/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/SJ7g80zm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/LCuJOhVS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/pTD1Dkya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/TG6vpG6X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/9ZcCh0ic/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:30.948Z"}